alid Tech ID for a casual group game on one of the six lanes; balls, tables, and automatic scoring are available in the alley.","short_summary":"A six-lane campus bowling alley inside Lambright.","evidence_claim":"The Lambright bowling alley has six lanes and is free for Louisiana Tech students with a valid student ID.","source_url":"https://www.latech.edu/student-life/student-support-and-resources/intramural-sports-recreation/bowling-alley.php","source_title":"Bowling Alley","source_kind":"university_official","source_published_at":null,"source_fetched_at":"2026-08-13","latitude":null,"longitude":null,"maps_url":null,"access_notes":"Open to currently enrolled students and current Lambright members; a valid student ID is required for free student use.","cost_status":"free","under21_safe":true},{"subject_id":"lambright-aquatics-facility","subject_type":"place","entity_name":"Lambright Sports & Wellness Center Aquatics Facility","title":"Use the Aquatics Facility","subtitle":"Lambright Sports & Wellness Center","notes":"Check the facility schedule before going, then choose the indoor pool for exercise or the seasonal outdoor leisure pool when it is operating.","short_summary":"Indoor competition/exercise lanes plus a seasonal outdoor leisure pool.","evidence_claim":"The Lambright Aquatics Facility has an indoor eight-lane, 25-yard pool for competition and exercise and an outdoor leisure pool open from late spring to early fall.","source_url":"https://www.latech.edu/student-life/student-support-and-resources/intramural-sports-recreation/aquatics.php","source_title":"Aquatics","source_kind":"university_official","source_published_at":null,"source_fetched_at":"2026-08-13","latitude":null,"longitude":null,"maps_url":null,"access_notes":"Students and members are welcomed; pool availability can change for weather and special events.","cost_status":"free","under21_safe":true},{"subject_id":"billy-jack-talton-fitness-room","subject_type":"place","entity_name":"Billy Jack Talt