ennial-plaza-centennial-tower","subject_type":"place","entity_name":"Centennial Plaza/Centennial Tower","title":"Meet at Centennial Plaza","subtitle":"Main campus landmark","notes":"Use the named plaza and tower as a clear rendezvous point while crossing campus, then consult the current campus map to orient your next stop.","short_summary":"A map-listed plaza and tower on Louisiana Tech’s main campus.","evidence_claim":"Louisiana Tech’s updated July 2025 campus map lists Centennial Plaza/Centennial Tower as a named main-campus destination.","source_url":"https://www.latech.edu/documents/campus-map-july-2025.pdf","source_title":"Louisiana Tech University Campus Map","source_kind":"university_official","source_published_at":"2025-07-01","source_fetched_at":"2026-08-13","latitude":null,"longitude":null,"maps_url":null,"access_notes":"Outdoor campus destination; follow posted campus access and parking rules.","cost_status":"unknown","under21_safe":true}],"warnings":[]}],"warnings":[]}
